WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.935
Joe: From Burger King to Starbucks,

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:04.137
here are the highest-calorie
items and meals

00:00:04.137 --> 00:00:06.806
in the US and the UK we
compared on the show.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.308
This is Food Wars.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:14.681
Harry: If you were to order
a Venti caramel Frappuccino

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:18.518
from a UK Starbucks, it
would contain 426 calories,

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:22.589
61.1 grams of sugar, and
117 milligrams of caffeine.

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:23.957
Joe: Harry, your Frappuccino's

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.091
looking a little sad there, buddy.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:26.493
Looks like all your whipped cream melted.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:28.628
So here's a pro tip from the USA.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:34.601
470 calories, 74 carbs,
73 of which are sugar,

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.704
and 120 milligrams of caffeine.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.907
Oh, yuck.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:41.908
Yuck.

00:00:41.908 --> 00:00:43.176
That's what that tastes like?

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.281
Harry: Well, in the UK, 6
inches of Meatball Marinara

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.550
comes in at 492 calories

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.652
Joe: In the US 6-inch meatball,

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:54.654
there's only 430 calories.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.089
Yo.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.424
Am I even in the shot
when I look at the camera?

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:58.258
Cameraman: Yeah, you are.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.963
Harry: Well, in the UK, a
Crunchwrap has 578 calories.

00:01:03.963 --> 00:01:04.798
But shockingly,

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:07.467
it has 60% of your daily
saturated fat allowance.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.737
Joe: In the US, our hexagram is 530 calories

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:14.307
and is about 6 grams of fat
less than the one in the UK.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:18.111
But, surprise to no one, ours has more sodium.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:19.679
As is always the case, in the US,

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.047
you have to look at the beverages.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:24.150
This right here is a large
Mountain Dew Baja Blast.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.853
This is 30 ounces of a liquid

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:29.189
that is the most unnatural
green I've ever seen.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.090
It glows in the dark.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:32.325
It's so bright. When I close
my eyes, I can still see it,

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.726
like when you look at the sun.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:38.565
This beverage has over 420 calories.

00:01:38.565 --> 00:01:39.732
That is ridiculous.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:40.867
I got to take a sip.

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.904
My body just took a screenshot.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.905
That is ridiculous

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:47.574
that anyone drinks more
than an ounce of that

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:48.908
ever in their lives.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.043
Apparently, people like drinking it.

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:51.277
It's very popular.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:56.249
This has roughly 110 grams of sugar.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:02:01.254
Ahem, for the people in
back: 110 grams of sugar!

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.622
That's way too much sugar

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.524
for a human being to have in a week.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:06.159
It's an absurd amount of sugar.

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.430
Oh, God, it's like it's
horrible, yet I'm addicted to it.

00:02:13.633 --> 00:02:14.801
Harry: For a large Whopper meal,

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:18.104
the Whopper itself is 627 calories.

00:02:18.104 --> 00:02:22.909
A 180-gram serving of large
fries would be 437 calories,

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:25.845
and a large Coke would be 209 calories.

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:29.048
That brings the total of a
large Whopper meal in the UK

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:31.684
to 1,273 calories.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.387
Joe: And in the US Burger King,

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:37.824
the Whopper meal comes in
at a hefty 1,600 calories.

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.562
Harry: If you are trying to
eat healthily at McDonald's,

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:43.563
it might actually be the drinks

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:45.064
that you have to look out for.

00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.336
Joe: That's nothing, guys.

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:54.374
Our chocolate shake, 840 calories.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:57.277
That's as many calories
as two cheeseburgers

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:58.845
and one hamburger.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.513
If you were to walk into a UK McDonald's

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.516
and order yourself a large
Big Mac meal with a milkshake,

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:05.818
it would be around 1,400 calories.

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:08.254
Joe: And if you were to
get the large Big Mac meal

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.023
with a chocolate shake in America,

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.860
the total here is 1,870 calories.

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:19.566
Harry: If you were to walk into a UK KFC

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:20.800
and order a three-piece meal

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.536
and they gave you a
drum, a thigh, and a wing

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:26.105
with a large fries and a large Pepsi,

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:29.909
that would come to 1,155 calories.

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:32.579
Joe: Our large fry is 930 calories

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:35.114
and our large drink is 380,

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:36.649
and if you were to order a three-piece

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:38.851
with a large fry and a large drink in the US,

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:41.287
it would be roughly this many calories.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:45.358
Harry: Let's compare large cheese pizzas

00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:46.893
in the two countries.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:49.429
This is what a UK large cheese looks like.

00:03:49.429 --> 00:03:52.632
