00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:55.335
Domino's cheese pizza looks like in the US.

00:03:55.335 --> 00:03:57.036
Harry: It's cut into 10 pieces,

00:03:57.036 --> 00:04:00.673
and each slice contains 176 calories.

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:01.975
That means that in total,

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:06.212
the pizza in the UK is 1,760 calories.

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:08.114
Joe: Instead of 10, we got eight slices.

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:11.384
That means each slice
is roughly 280 calories,

00:04:11.384 --> 00:04:15.788
which makes the whole
pizza 2,240 calories.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.890
And according to the thing
that was written for me,

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:21.561
that is almost 480 calories
more than the UK large.

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:26.165
So a plain cheeseburger, regular fries,

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:27.033
and a chocolate shake

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:30.570
