00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:42.515
well, that comes to a
total of 2,769 calories.

00:04:42.515 --> 00:04:44.450
Two calories more than in the US.

00:04:47.687 --> 00:04:48.521
Well, in the UK,

00:04:48.521 --> 00:04:51.424
